## 26. Worked Example: Shopping Discount

### Problem

Calculate final price after discount.

### Important Details

```text
original price
membership status
discount rate
minimum spending threshold
tax if required
```

### Unnecessary Details

```text
product shelf location
cashier name
store wall colour
shopping bag colour
```

### Algorithm Idea

```text
INPUT price
INPUT isMember

IF isMember = true THEN
    discount ← price * 0.10
ELSE
    discount ← 0
ENDIF

finalPrice ← price - discount
OUTPUT finalPrice
```

### Explanation

Only the data affecting final price is kept.

